{
  "title": "VibeCode Azure Embedding Service Monitoring",
  "description": "Comprehensive monitoring dashboard for Azure OpenAI embedding service operations, including API usage, costs, performance metrics, and error tracking",
  "widgets": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Embedding Request Rate",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "sum:vibecode.embedding.requests.total{$env,$service}.as_rate()",
            "display_type": "line",
            "style": {
              "palette": "dog_classic",
              "line_type": "solid",
              "line_width": "normal"
            }
          }
        ],
        "yaxis": {
          "label": "Requests/Second",
          "scale": "linear",
          "min": "auto",
          "max": "auto",
          "include_zero": true
        },
        "show_legend": true,
        "legend_layout": "auto"
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "width": 4,
        "height": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Embedding Generation Latency",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "avg:vibecode.embedding.duration{$env,$service,operation:generate}",
            "display_type": "line",
            "style": {
              "palette": "orange",
              "line_type": "solid",
              "line_width": "normal"
            }
          },
          {
            "q": "p95:vibecode.embedding.duration{$env,$service,operation:generate}",
            "display_type": "line",
            "style": {
              "palette": "red",
              "line_type": "solid",
              "line_width": "normal"
            }
          }
        ],
        "yaxis": {
          "label": "Latency (ms)",
          "scale": "linear",
          "min": "auto",
          "max": "auto",
          "include_zero": true
        },
        "markers": [
          {
            "value": "y = 2000",
            "display_type": "warning dashed",
            "label": "High Latency Threshold"
          },
          {
            "value": "y = 5000",
            "display_type": "error dashed",
            "label": "Critical Latency"
          }
        ]
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 4,
        "y": 0,
        "width": 4,
        "height": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "definition": {
        "type": "query_value",
        "title": "Token Usage Rate",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "sum:vibecode.embedding.tokens{$env,$service}.as_rate()",
            "aggregator": "avg",
            "conditional_formats": [
              {
                "comparator": ">",
                "value": 1000,
                "palette": "white_on_red"
              },
              {
                "comparator": ">=",
                "value": 500,
                "palette": "white_on_yellow"
              },
              {
                "comparator": "<",
                "value": 500,
                "palette": "white_on_green"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "custom_unit": "tokens/sec",
        "precision": 1
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 0,
        "width": 2,
        "height": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "definition": {
        "type": "query_value",
        "title": "Hourly Cost Estimate",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "sum:vibecode.embedding.cost{$env,$service}.as_rate() * 3600",
            "aggregator": "avg",
            "conditional_formats": [
              {
                "comparator": ">",
                "value": 10,
                "palette": "white_on_red"
              },
              {
                "comparator": ">=",
                "value": 5,
                "palette": "white_on_yellow"
              },
              {
                "comparator": "<",
                "value": 5,
                "palette": "white_on_green"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "custom_unit": "$",
        "precision": 4
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 10,
        "y": 0,
        "width": 2,
        "height": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Error Rate",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "sum:vibecode.embedding.requests.errors{$env,$service}.as_rate() / sum:vibecode.embedding.requests.total{$env,$service}.as_rate() * 100",
            "display_type": "line",
            "style": {
              "palette": "red",
              "line_type": "solid",
              "line_width": "normal"
            }
          }
        ],
        "yaxis": {
          "label": "Error Rate %",
          "scale": "linear",
          "min": 0,
          "max": "auto",
          "include_zero": true
        },
        "markers": [
          {
            "value": "y = 5",
            "display_type": "warning dashed",
            "label": "High Error Rate"
          },
          {
            "value": "y = 10",
            "display_type": "error dashed",
            "label": "Critical Error Rate"
          }
        ]
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 1,
        "width": 4,
        "height": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "definition": {
        "type": "toplist",
        "title": "Top Error Types",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "top(sum:vibecode.embedding.errors_by_type{$env,$service} by {error_type}, 10, 'sum', 'desc')",
            "conditional_formats": [
              {
                "comparator": ">",
                "value": 10,
                "palette": "white_on_red"
              },
              {
                "comparator": ">=",
                "value": 5,
                "palette": "white_on_yellow"
              },
              {
                "comparator": "<",
                "value": 5,
                "palette": "white_on_green"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 2,
        "width": 4,
        "height": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Token Cost Efficiency",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "sum:vibecode.embedding.cost{$env,$service} / sum:vibecode.embedding.tokens{$env,$service} * 1000",
            "display_type": "line",
            "style": {
              "palette": "purple",
              "line_type": "solid",
              "line_width": "normal"
            }
          }
        ],
        "yaxis": {
          "label": "Cost per 1K tokens",
          "scale": "linear",
          "min": "auto",
          "max": "auto",
          "include_zero": true
        }
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 4,
        "y": 2,
        "width": 4,
        "height": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "definition": {
        "type": "heatmap",
        "title": "Request Latency Distribution",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "vibecode.embedding.duration{$env,$service,operation:generate}"
          }
        ],
        "yaxis": {
          "label": "Latency (ms)",
          "scale": "sqrt",
          "min": "auto",
          "max": "auto",
          "include_zero": false
        }
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 2,
        "width": 4,
        "height": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Embedding Operations by Type",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "sum:vibecode.embedding.generate.rate{$env,$service}.as_rate()",
            "display_type": "area",
            "style": {
              "palette": "blue",
              "line_type": "solid",
              "line_width": "normal"
            }
          },
          {
            "q": "sum:vibecode.embedding.store.rate{$env,$service}.as_rate()",
            "display_type": "area",
            "style": {
              "palette": "green",
              "line_type": "solid",
              "line_width": "normal"
            }
          },
          {
            "q": "sum:vibecode.embedding.search.rate{$env,$service}.as_rate()",
            "display_type": "area",
            "style": {
              "palette": "orange",
              "line_type": "solid",
              "line_width": "normal"
            }
          }
        ],
        "yaxis": {
          "label": "Operations/Second",
          "scale": "linear",
          "min": "auto",
          "max": "auto",
          "include_zero": true
        }
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "width": 6,
        "height": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Alert Frequency",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "sum:vibecode.embedding.alerts{$env,$service} by {alert_type}.as_rate()",
            "display_type": "bars",
            "style": {
              "palette": "red",
              "line_type": "solid",
              "line_width": "normal"
            }
          }
        ],
        "yaxis": {
          "label": "Alerts/Hour",
          "scale": "linear",
          "min": 0,
          "max": "auto",
          "include_zero": true
        }
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 4,
        "width": 6,
        "height": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "## Azure Embedding Service Monitoring\n\nThis dashboard provides comprehensive monitoring of Azure OpenAI embedding service operations.\n\n### Key Metrics:\n- **Request Rate**: Monitor API call frequency\n- **Latency**: Track response times (target < 2s)\n- **Token Usage**: Monitor token consumption and costs\n- **Error Rates**: Track failures and error types\n- **Cost Efficiency**: Monitor cost per 1K tokens\n\n### Alerts:\n- High latency (>5s)\n- Error rate >10%\n- High token usage (>100K/hour)\n- High costs (>$10/hour)\n\n### Actions:\n- Review error breakdown for troubleshooting\n- Monitor cost trends for budget management\n- Optimize based on latency patterns",
        "background_color": "gray",
        "font_size": "14",
        "text_align": "left",
        "show_tick": true,
        "tick_pos": "50%",
        "tick_edge": "bottom"
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 3
      }
    }
  ],
  "template_variables": [
    {
      "name": "env",
      "default": "*",
      "prefix": "env",
      "available_values": [
        "production",
        "staging",
        "development"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "service",
      "default": "vibecode-webgui",
      "prefix": "service",
      "available_values": [
        "vibecode-webgui"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "layout_type": "ordered",
  "is_read_only": false,
  "notify_list": [],
  "reflow_type": "fixed"
}